    "slug": "startup-costs-accounting",
    "title": "Startup Costs Accounting: Expenses, Assets and Cash Records",
    "seoTitle": "Startup Costs Accounting: Books vs Tax",
    "description": "Classify startup payments as expenses, assets, deposits or funding. Reconcile a checked launch example and keep book treatment separate from US tax recovery.",
    "metaDescription": "Classify startup payments as expenses, assets, deposits or funding. Reconcile a checked launch example and keep book treatment separate from US tax recovery.",
